  storyText: "Aiko's Route\n\nAiko leads you through service tunnels. \"Arasaka's research servers here connect close to the Blackwall. If she wants to go home, this is a door.\"\n\n\"Or I can get you to the roof, and you disappear.\"\n\n1. Jack in from the Arasaka servers.\n2. Just get out. Go to the roof."
